      "content": "i knew i wasn't crazy. the way you put it about it being a \"deliberate strategy\" makes so much sense because they always seem to come by when the street is totally empty. \n\nhere are the times i've jotted down:\nMon 2:45am - corner of 5th and Maple (just stood by the hydrant for 20 mins)\nWed 3:10am - my street (near the oak tree, they were using some kind of handheld device)\nFri 4:00am - back at 5th and Maple again\nSun 3:30am - near my driveway\n\nthe fact they keep coming back to the same intersection and my specific street is too much. looking at these times and the locations, does this look like a sequence to you? like, are they doing a sweep or something?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
